'''Gross Cat''' is one of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]], and the first ranged attacker the player gets. He is unlocked after clearing [[Cambodia (Empire of Cats)|Cambodia]] in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1 and costs 0 XP (3,000 in [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]]) or a [[Cat Capsule|Normal Cat Capsule]] to unlock. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]] doubles health and attack power, gains [[Strong Against|Strong]] against [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]], and increases recharge. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it is unlocked from clearing [[Philippines (Empire of Cats)|Philippines]] in the Empire of Cats Chapter or rolling the Normal Cat Capsule.

