==Trivia==
*In [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]], Gross Cat costs 3,000 [[XP Function|XP]] to unlock instead of 0.
*[[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.4 Update|Version 2.0.4]] reduced Macho Leg Cat's base health from 1,200 to 800 and base attack from 300 to 200, and increased base recharge from 330f<sup>11s</sup> to 490f<sup>16.33s</sup>.
*[[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]] gave Macho Leg Cat the [[Strong Against|Strong]] against [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]] ability.
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Sexy Legs Cat was a part of three other [[Cat Combo]]s: [[Cat Army MkII (Removed Combo)|Cat Army MkII]], [[Maxed Out (Removed Combo)|Maxed Out]] and [[Cover Girl (Removed Combo)|Cover Girl]].
*Prior to [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]], Gross Cat and [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Ninja Cat]] became unlockable after clearing the [[Philippines (Empire of Cats)|Philippines/Ōita Prefecture]], rather than [[Cambodia (Empire of Cats)|Cambodia/Miyazaki Prefecture]].
*Unlike all other variants of this Cat, Macho Leg Cat doesn't use plural for "Leg" in its name.
*There was a typo in its old Normal Form description saying "Able to do very a long range attack" when it should be "Able to do a very long range attack".
*Gross Cat is one of the two Normal Cats that have a faster attack animation and speed in their Evolved and True Forms than in their Normal Forms, the other being [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Lizard Cat]].
*Gross Cat and [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cat]] have different animations in forms.
*Variants of [[Actress Cat (Special Cat)|Actress Cat]] usually have descriptions referencing Sexy Legs/Macho Leg Cat, as when combined, they appear humanoid.
*Sexy Legs Cat has the 2nd most variants of any [[Cat Units|Cat Unit]], behind the titular [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]].
*One of the possible endings for [[Gamatoto Expedition]] log messages is "with Sexy Legs Cat."
*Prior to [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]], Gross Cat's descriptions read as follows:
<pre>Gross Cat
Able to do very a powerful long range attack.
Exceptional attack power and range. </pre>
<pre>Sexy Legs Cat
Has pride in his overly beautiful legs.
Exceptional attack power and range. </pre>
<pre>Macho Leg Cat
Every day is Leg Day. Mastered the Art of Leg.
Exceptional attack power and range.
Strong against Aliens! </pre>

